    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i can't really get to a doctor right now, i'm working a double shift and its super expensive to go to urgent care. do u think it could just be electrolytes? maybe if i just drink some gatorade or something more intense like liquid iv it'll balance me out?",
